{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_005_03_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7d9aabc45b06754084efdfce09f2e175714e72a7fb74922a162bbc24aee0b64f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bf57c01d39f73d63fd43e39e72008b6c7bdbac6dec731a2109de94cb7bdd6ce",
      "text": "呼，已经这个时间了啊……\n糟了，比赛已经开始了！电视，电视！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84d832a4e5ab2599b429888880ce7bd5f52f36d8c7b51f45ef63a9e972351a2f",
      "text": "啊，被压制了啊。情况看起来很不妙呢。\n……嗯？享介呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73b86a517cbb377bde3e1f9e18f446d03a321bcb3f3bb14158872ae0ad801a37",
      "text": "好的，苍井享介选手退回了替补席。\n球队能从这里展开反击吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4e853c04696aa6c65323b5ec0e3fbeff8c412474c639a9432fd98a06caef8a2",
      "text": "享介被换下了！？为什么！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9205dabb084bd9df5b7800f6434bb96d23f16c66c3294673d9ade0c87ce28092",
      "text": "那么，请看比赛的精彩集锦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:649ebedcfdb31efa99a5bdec3c23db10ca8fc656ef539edd93df39f581639a61",
      "text": "对方球队的中场，是个擅长盘带的选手。\n但要是享介的话应该能断下来的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a077b31f14c5b0db0121f47bd2410f44940080d5c5d4dfe2015151e4a952ec79",
      "text": "……骗人的吧，被过掉了！\n享介竟然会犯这种低级失误。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e71dcf69178533f9dd8f7010e6bdc901bfb81535cce5abcc3c19f7d20c0bfa5",
      "text": "要是我在的话，绝对不会犯那种失误的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_b:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a88f5d9fee7b68123bf9c430af17316a7651e5b7a7c5126e12a4d3ea732759c9",
      "text": "（而且换做平时的享介，\n绝对不会那么轻易被断球的！）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
